    "id": "Quotient",
    "package": "TypeTheory",
    "kind": "def",
    "title": {
      "type": "i18n",
      "default_language": "en",
      "values": {
        "en": "Quotient type",
        "zh-CN": "商类型"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "Let A be a type and S : Setoid A. The quotient type Quotient S is generated by classes [x]ₛ for x : A, identifying exactly those representatives for which S.r x y holds. Every element is represented by some x : A. Its elimination to a type B is given by a function f : A → B that takes equal values on S-related representatives.",
          "zh-CN": "设 A 为类型，S : Setoid A。商类型 Quotient S 由 x : A 的类 [x]ₛ 生成，恰将满足 S.r x y 的代表识别为相等。每个商元素都有代表 x : A。它到类型 B 的映射由在 S 相关代表上取相同值的函数 f : A → B 给出。"
        }
      },
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@A,Type),Type.annotation(@S,Setoid(A))),def[axiomaticType](Quotient[native](A,S),Type,__enum__[enumerate](Type.forall[forall](@a,A,Type.annotation(Quotient.mk(A,S,a),Quotient[native](A,S))),Type.forall[forall](__list__[formula](@b,@c),A,Iff(Eq(Quotient[native](A,S),Quotient.mk(A,S,b),Quotient.mk(A,S,c)),Type.apply[paren](Type.apply[paren](Setoid.r(A,S),b),c))),Type.forall[forall](@u,Quotient[native](A,S),Logic.exists-typed(@v,A,Eq(Quotient[native](A,S),Quotient.mk(A,S,v),u))),Type.forall[forall](@B,Type,Type.forall[forall](@f,Type.to(A,B),Iff(parentheses(ExistsUnique[binder](@g,Type.to(Quotient[native](A,S),B),Type.forall[forall](@x,A,Eq(B,Type.apply[paren](g,Quotient.mk(A,S,x)),Type.apply[paren](f,x))))),parentheses(Type.forall[forall](__list__[formula](@y,@z),A,Logic.implies(Type.apply[paren](Type.apply[paren](Setoid.r(A,S),y),z),Eq(B,Type.apply[paren](f,y),Type.apply[paren](f,z)))))))))))"
    },
